Package: contentvalidR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Substantive and Content Validity Pretesting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Joshua", family = "Uhalt", email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: Compute Psa and Csv for item sorts (Anderson and Gerbing, 1991); an ANOVA/Tukey approach for rating studies (Hinkin and Tracey, 1999); and classic indices (Aiken's V, CVR, CVI, IOC), with diagnostics and small power simulators.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: tibble
Suggests: dplyr, testthat (>= 3.0.0), rmarkdown, knitr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/JUhalt/contentvalidR, https://juhalt.github.io/contentvalidR/
BugReports: https://github.com/JUhalt/contentvalidR/issues
